<title>USA: Smart &amp; Final stake raised by Baron group.</title>
<headline>Smart &amp; Final stake raised by Baron group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group controlled by New York investor Ronald Baron said Monday it has increased its stake in Smart &amp; Final Inc to 16.6 percent or 3,660,920 common shares from a last reported 15.3 percent or 3,345,895 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, Baron said his group acquired additional shares of the Vernon, Calif. warehouse store chain between April 18 and June 16 at $19.63 to $22.99 each.</p>
